step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test the best single model hypothesis – use the top-ranked CWT_rf alone.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"CWT_rf"}

Thought: Test a simple median over the 5 most stable models (pool1) to see if a robust middle aggregator beats the single best.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination with inverse error on the most stable pool (pool2) to see if it improves over the best single model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["CWT_rf","DWT_rf","FT_rf","DWT_catboost","FT_catboost","ONLY_DWT_catboost"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple median over pool2 to see if robust aggregation beats weighted or best single.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse_error combination on pool3 to see if weighting the top models improves over best_single.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["CWT_rf","DWT_rf","FT_rf","CWT_catboost","DWT_catboost","FT_catboost"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median aggregation over the larger pool3 to see if it improves on best_single.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Try a DBA strategy on pool4 to see if iterative refinement improves over the best single model.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool4","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool5 to see if averaging the top six models improves over best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool5"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean over pool4 to see if trimming improves on the best single CWT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean over pool5 to see if trimming the top and bottom improves over the current best single model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool5","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Evaluate a simple mean over pool4 to see if averaging a slightly smaller stable set beats the trimmed mean on pool5.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a median over the smaller pool5 to see if robustness improves over the best mean pool5.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool5"}

